"id": "section-1",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scope\">Dishwasher installation Perth: service scope</h2><ul><li>Supply the agreed dishwasher, disconnect and remove the old unit, and take it away.</li><li>Check the proposed water supply, drainage and available electrical connection.</li><li>Include required plumbing and fixed electrical work in the written scope through the appropriate trade.</li><li>Cabinet alterations, new service routes and internal appliance repairs are separate from a standard connection and are not automatically included.</li></ul><p>We confirm the property, installation and requested outcome before selecting the work. Fixed plumbing and electrical tasks are handled by the appropriate qualified trade; a coordinated visit does not make every task interchangeable. Current documentation relevant to the proposed work can be requested privately.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Perth plumbing services</a></li><li><a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Kitchen and laundry connection overview</a></li><li><a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">Sink drainage and backflow</a></li><li><a href=\"power-points-perth.html\">Electrical outlet requirements</a></li><li><a href=\"tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Leaking supply taps and mixers</a></li><li><a href=\"service-areas.html\">Perth service regions</a></li></ul></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-2",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section expanded-scenarios\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scenarios\">Common situations and what to report</h2><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>Replacing a dishwasher in the same space</h3><p>An old dishwasher is being replaced and the connection under the kitchen sink is leaking. The new appliance and the existing tap, hose connection and drain arrangement need to be considered together. A same-space replacement does not guarantee that every existing connection can be reused.</p></div><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>A new location or water backing into the sink</h3><p>A first dishwasher installation may need new supply or drain work and suitable power. If both sink bowls fill when the dishwasher drains, report the drainage symptom as well as the installation request; replacing the machine alone may not address a downstream blockage.</p></div><p>These are illustrative situations, not customer case studies or diagnoses. Report what you have noticed; you do not need to identify the cause before contacting us.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-3",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-quote\">Assessment, work plan and written quote</h2><ol class=\"expanded-steps\"><li><strong>Describe the job.</strong> Give the suburb, affected equipment or planned installation, when it began and whether the condition is worsening. Add safe access and the person who can approve the work.</li><li><strong>Assess the installation.</strong> We check the relevant equipment and connections on site. Concealed work, product compatibility and the cause of a fault cannot be guaranteed from an enquiry or photograph.</li><li><strong>Agree the scope.</strong> The written quote identifies attendance or investigation, the selected equipment, materials and agreed work. Confirm GST, disposal, access, testing and any making good that applies to the specific job.</li><li><strong>Approve changes separately.</strong> If findings change the required work, we explain the additional scope and charge before proceeding. Confirm the checks and completion information needed for a rental or managed property.</li></ol><p>Published standard-hours guide ranges elsewhere on this site are not a fixed price for this unseen job. Emergency repair charges follow the quoted plan. There is no assumed free attendance, unlimited investigation or universal hourly rate.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Dishwasher Installation &amp; Connections Perth FAQs</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Prepare the request and approval</h3><p>Give the property location, observable symptoms or intended installation, access contact and the person who can approve the work. The agreed quote sets out the assessment and work; submitting a form does not reserve an appointment.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Perth plumbing services</a></li><li><a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Kitchen and laundry connection overview</a></li><li><a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">Sink drainage and backflow</a></li><li><a href=\"power-points-perth.html\">Electrical outlet requirements</a></li><li><a href=\"tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Leaking supply taps and mixers</a></li></ul></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
