"html": "\n<section class=\"section contact-band\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Arrange dishwasher installation &amp; connections</h2><p>Send the property location, a brief description, proposed product details where relevant, access contact and approval requirements. For a rental, coordinate the request with the owner or managing agent. The appointment and work are agreed with you rather than reserved by submitting a form.</p><p>Photos are optional: email safely taken photos to maxinemaintenance.au@outlook.com. Do not remove covers, open walls, approach electrical hazards or include private tenant information in public photographs.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=dishwasher-installation-perth.html\">Request an assessment &amp; written quote</a><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"property-management.html\">Property-manager approvals and access</a></li><li><a href=\"faq.html\">Booking and quotation FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"about.html\">About Ellis Services Group</a></li></ul></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
